WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.870
All out winter warfare.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.638
On the eastern front.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:06.506
We're in a trench

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.843
with Ukrainian paratroopers

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.913
They fire on Russian positions using

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:17.050
AK's and a US supplied Browning

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.785
heavy machine gun.

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.253
They're searching for weak spots

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.021
in our positions

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:23.223
as the commander callsign ghost.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.625
They want to see if we fight back.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.560
We show strong resistance, though

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.763
they don't advance

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.532
And this is what strong resistance

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.433
looks like.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:36.036
Bull through

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.472
the Russians are only about 400

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:42.542
yards away, hidden in the snow and fog,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:43.676
but constantly

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:47.113
firing at the entrenched Ukrainian

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.349
Then the enemy uses all kinds of weapons,

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.150
Bogdan says.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.118
Small arms, heavy machine guns,

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.887
artillery, mortars, rocket

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.724
launchers and aviation as well.

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.860
But so far,

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:01.961
the Ukrainians say

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:02.362
they haven't

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.631
lost an inch of territory here.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.332
The Ukrainians say the situation here

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.168
is reminiscent of some of the worst times

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:09.102
in World War Two,

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.370
where they're not only fighting

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.771
a strong adversary, but

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:12.806
the elements as well.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.942
The snow the mud

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:16.976
and the cold

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:20.713
make fighting here even tougher.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.148
And Ukraine's leadership believes

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.551
the Russians will soon escalate even more

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:26.119
after mobilizing hundreds

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.287
of thousands of men

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:29.355
for a likely spring offensive

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:32.225
But this gunner, who goes by the name

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:33.193
deputy, says

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.695
the paratroopers are ready to drive off.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:36.963
It will be hard, he says.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:37.964
It will be tough,

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:38.898
but we will hold

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.934
because we stand here for our land.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.136
If we don't do it, nobody will move.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.705
There's a visceral hatred

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.874
towards Moscow's leaders among these men.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:50.443
Verses are of them in Russia.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:51.311
They have a terrorist,

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:53.446
dictatorial regime, Bogdan says.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.148
So now the civilized world

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:56.983
is fighting against this wild

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.885
medieval dictatorship.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.253
As we prepare to leave,

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:03.156
incoming grenades explode above the sky.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:04.023
And this,

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:06.493
the men say, is a relatively quiet day.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.595
They expect much worse in the months

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:09.262
to come.

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:12.098
But their motto is, If not us, who else

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:16.269
And Aaron,

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:16.703
that is the

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:18.505
reality on the ground there

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:19.772
and in so many other places

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.241
on Ukraine's eastern front.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.041
You were mentioning

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.143
the Ukrainian defense minister

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:25.345
saying he believes up to 500,000

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:26.212
people could already

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.081
have been mobilized by the Russians

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.315
in every single place

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.483
that we've been going to.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.318
On the eastern front here in Ukraine.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.219
They have been telling

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.254
us, the Ukrainians,

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:35.455
that they believe that the Russians

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:37.423
have already beefed up their forces.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:38.691
And certainly the Ukrainian government

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:39.592
today said

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:40.193
that they believe

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:41.361
that the month of February

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.328
and the month of March

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:43.730
are going to be extremely tough

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.398
for the Ukrainians on the ground.

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:46.466
They obviously say

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:47.734
they need more Western weapons

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:48.801
to hold their ground.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.036
But they also say, of course,

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.004
they are not going to give up

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.305
an inch of their territory

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.806
without a fight Erin.

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.542
Fred, thank you very much.

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:56.476
It's an incredible report.

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.510
And I want to bring in now

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.178
to talk about it

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.879
a Caterina called Jacuzzi.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:01.814
The news director and anchor for TV Rain,

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:02.782
which is an independent

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:03.917
Russian language television

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:04.884
channel, shut down

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:05.818
by the Russian government

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:06.953
at the start of the war.

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.321
Also with me, retired Army

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:09.756
Brigadier General Mark Kimmitt,

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.457
a former assistant secretary of state

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:13.126
for political military affairs

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:14.160
Thanks to both.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:14.727
General Kimmitt,

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:15.528
let me begin with you,

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:16.296
because you hear, Fred,

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:18.531
the Ukrainian troops he's speaking to.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:18.698
You know,

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:20.433
they say today was a quiet day,

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:21.034
a quiet day,

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:23.102
as we just heard, the nonstop

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.437
right artillery in the distance,

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:26.372
the grenades exploding overhead

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.574
as he was leaving.

00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:29.042
And the defense minister of Ukraine

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.643
is saying that Russia's already

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.312
mobilized 500,000 soldiers,

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:33.379
that they're seeing them amassed

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:34.981
on these borders again.

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.416
Do you think that we're about to see

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:38.218
a big change in this war?

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:40.587
Well, I really don't.

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:40.954
I think

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.622
we may see a big change in this war

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:43.556
in a couple of months.

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:45.258
But as the soldiers

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.060
said, this is very much like World

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.294
War Two note.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:48.595
In fact,

00:03:48.595 --> 00:03:50.196
this is like World War One,

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:52.465
the trench warfare in France

00:03:53.066 --> 00:03:56.069
that went on for years and years.

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:56.869
Unfortunately,

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:57.403
I think

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.404
in the near term,

00:03:58.404 --> 00:03:59.439
we're going to see much

00:03:59.439 --> 00:04:00.139
the same

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:01.207
for the next couple of months

00:04:01.207 --> 00:04:03.476
until one side or the other prepares

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:04.944
for a counteroffensive.

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:06.145
That's why we got the tanks.

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:07.614
That's why we're bringing in the tanks.

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:09.816
So the Ukrainians have a chance

00:04:09.816 --> 00:04:10.550
and the Russians

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.185
may have plans on the road.

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:13.052
But I certainly hope

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:14.887
we're interdicting their lines

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:16.623
to make sure the majority of these troops

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:17.957
never show up.

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:20.760
Ekaterina, you pointed out to us

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.229
that sound byte we played of sort of the

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:24.764
the most prominent

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:26.366
Russian state media, television anchor.

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:26.532
Right.

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:27.734
Threatening that if the Russians don't

00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:29.435
win, it's nuclear World War three.

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:30.236
And you're pointing out

00:04:30.236 --> 00:04:31.871
that a lot of the Putin TV

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:32.839
commentators on state

00:04:32.839 --> 00:04:34.207
media are backing more action.

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:35.642
They really are upping the rhetoric

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:36.476
right now.

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:38.444
Let me play how another prominent TV

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:39.212
host put it

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:42.548
not clear, not talk

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:43.716
about this without a third.

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:46.085
Why would our state build up a stockpile

00:04:46.085 --> 00:04:46.819
of strategic

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:49.489
and tactical nuclear missiles that you.

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:50.990
Why

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.226
start

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:56.329
just to be afraid of using them

00:04:57.497 --> 00:04:57.897
carrying?

00:04:57.897 --> 00:04:58.898
What do you read into that?

00:04:58.898 --> 00:05:00.133
And what does the Russian

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:03.803
public really think at this point?

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:05.371
This was Vladimir Solovyov,

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:07.140
one of the biggest

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.609
since Russian propaganda, Erin.

00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:11.978
Actually, the situation right now

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.980
is dangerous for Vladimir Putin.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:17.083
As we can see, they don't have any other

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.686
any other tools to use

00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:21.054
for the Russian public

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:22.588
and for the Western world,

00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:24.390
except for the threats.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.858
They are threatening the world

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:26.793
with this World War

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:28.561
Three with the nuclear weapon,

00:05:28.561 --> 00:05:29.762
because this is the last hope

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:31.831
that they can catch right now

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.666
and all over the world,

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:37.203
the attitude of people in Russia is

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:38.671
is fear,

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:39.772
actually,

00:05:39.772 --> 00:05:41.874
that society is terribly depressed.

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:43.309
People understand

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:45.378
that this is the war, actually,

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:47.013
that this is not a special

00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:47.914
military operation,

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:49.215
how they called it before.

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:52.118
Vladimir Putin is already calling this

00:05:52.118 --> 00:05:52.852
a war.

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:53.486
And Sergey

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:54.987
Lavrov, the minister for foreign affairs

00:05:54.987 --> 00:05:55.888
and others,

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:58.658
they're not hiding anymore that this is

00:05:58.658 --> 00:05:59.759
a very

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:01.260
serious situation

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:02.095
and people

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:04.130
are understanding it right now.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.365
So this is the new stage

00:06:05.365 --> 00:06:06.933
for Russian society.

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:09.502
And they can hear this words

00:06:09.502 --> 00:06:11.270
about the nuclear weapon.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.706
I know that people are scared to death.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.341
They don't want this nuclear war,

00:06:15.341 --> 00:06:15.908
of course,

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:17.610
because they don't want to die.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.311
They want to

00:06:19.512 --> 00:06:20.980
raise their children

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.315
and so on and so forth.

00:06:22.315 --> 00:06:25.151
So they are looking for some kind of,

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:30.356
you know, maybe a kind and soft moment.

00:06:30.623 --> 00:06:31.691
There are looking forward

00:06:31.691 --> 00:06:35.294
to maybe freezing this this war

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:38.264
because this is the only way to survive

00:06:38.364 --> 00:06:39.732
for Russian citizens.

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:42.201
They don't know how to see the future

00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:43.302
without Vladimir Putin

00:06:43.302 --> 00:06:45.304
because he has built

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:47.306
a terrible, repressive state

00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:48.007
where no one

00:06:48.007 --> 00:06:50.276
has the right to think freely

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:52.612
or to talk freely, as you know.

00:06:52.812 --> 00:06:54.046
So, General Kimmitt,

00:06:54.046 --> 00:06:55.248
you know, a well-known

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:56.516
and highly respected

00:06:56.516 --> 00:06:57.183
Russian analyst

00:06:57.183 --> 00:06:58.751
said this about the current state

00:06:58.751 --> 00:06:59.852
of the Russian military

00:06:59.852 --> 00:07:00.453
in the context

00:07:00.453 --> 00:07:01.621
of what Ekaterina just said.

00:07:01.621 --> 00:07:02.622
Here it is.

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:05.591
Both Charles and I believe that

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:07.260
by the start of the mobilization,

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.430
our airborne forces lost 40 to 50%

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:11.097
of the staff.

00:07:12.732 --> 00:07:13.166
Look, it's an

00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:14.267
incredible admission, right,

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:15.134
happening on one of those

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:16.502
very same programs. General.

00:07:16.502 --> 00:07:18.638
So I do want to emphasize that.

00:07:18.638 --> 00:07:20.039
But to say something like that.

00:07:20.039 --> 00:07:21.107
But nearly half of Russia's

00:07:21.107 --> 00:07:22.742
airborne forces are gone.

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:23.676
I mean, it's stunning

00:07:23.676 --> 00:07:24.777
but then I think about what

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:25.912
the Ukrainian defense minister

00:07:25.912 --> 00:07:26.479
said today,

00:07:26.479 --> 00:07:28.681
that Russia has 500,000

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:30.616
more soldiers coming.

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:33.419
General, what is the real picture here?

00:07:33.419 --> 00:07:33.619
Well,

00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:35.688
I think the real picture is quantity

00:07:35.688 --> 00:07:37.590
has some quality all its own.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:39.192
If they are going to be pouring

00:07:39.192 --> 00:07:40.660
500,000 troops

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:41.861
and that's going to make

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:42.962
a significant difference,

00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:44.897
no matter how many tanks we give,

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:47.266
no matter how much artillery they have.

00:07:47.733 --> 00:07:50.269
But I wouldn't put too much stock

00:07:50.269 --> 00:07:52.004
in what the defense minister said.

00:07:52.004 --> 00:07:53.739
There's an old saying military

00:07:53.739 --> 00:07:55.842
The first report is usually wrong.

00:07:56.242 --> 00:07:57.143
And that seems like

00:07:57.143 --> 00:07:58.511
an awfully large number

00:07:58.511 --> 00:07:59.512
to anybody

00:07:59.512 --> 00:08:01.380
that's been following this for some time.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.081
It certainly does.

00:08:02.081 --> 00:08:02.248
I mean,

00:08:02.248 --> 00:08:03.182
you heard it today and said

00:08:03.182 --> 00:08:04.083
wait a minute,

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:04.717
it wasn't

00:08:04.717 --> 00:08:05.551
the math that we'd heard

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:07.053
of the mobilization or anything.

00:08:07.053 --> 00:08:09.322
But but it is a stunning number.

00:08:09.322 --> 00:08:11.424
Ekaterina, you have extensively covered

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:13.759
Putin. Opposition Leader Alexi Navalny.

00:08:14.227 --> 00:08:15.528
He is in the news today.

00:08:15.528 --> 00:08:16.062
His lawyer

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:17.697
saying that he is being transferred

00:08:17.697 --> 00:08:19.999
to even harsher solitary confinement.

00:08:20.032 --> 00:08:21.534
He, of course, is the opposition

00:08:21.534 --> 00:08:22.702
leader in Russia

00:08:22.702 --> 00:08:24.637
and was poisoned by Putin's men

00:08:24.637 --> 00:08:26.305
and then put into a penal colony.

00:08:26.305 --> 00:08:27.273
Sometimes he's able

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:28.741
to pass messages to his team

00:08:28.741 --> 00:08:30.343
and then they post them on Twitter today.

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:31.410
That happened

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.212
and this was posted quote,

00:08:33.212 --> 00:08:34.514
When something like this happens to you,

00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:35.882
you realize how important it is

00:08:35.882 --> 00:08:37.950
to fight this unscrupulous regime,

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.151
how important it is to do

00:08:39.151 --> 00:08:40.486
just about anything in order

00:08:40.486 --> 00:08:42.121
to throw the yoke of these scoundrels

00:08:42.121 --> 00:08:43.022
off Russia.

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:43.556
And dispel

00:08:43.556 --> 00:08:44.790
the illusion that they have planted

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.025
in the heads of millions.

00:08:46.025 --> 00:08:47.493
Let us try to remain strong

00:08:47.493 --> 00:08:49.729
and do all we can every day.

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:52.064
And yet he physically seems weaker

00:08:52.064 --> 00:08:53.466
every time we get an image of him.

00:08:53.466 --> 00:08:54.033
Ekaterina,

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:54.767
as I said

00:08:54.767 --> 00:08:56.035
today, going to even harsher

00:08:56.035 --> 00:08:57.537
solitary confinement.

00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:59.038
What happens if he doesn't survive

00:09:00.773 --> 00:09:03.042
it's going to be a huge problem for him

00:09:03.576 --> 00:09:05.645
because he has already tried to kill him,

00:09:05.645 --> 00:09:06.913
and we know that.

00:09:06.913 --> 00:09:09.982
But it was a different time right now

00:09:09.982 --> 00:09:12.118
when the level of fear

00:09:12.118 --> 00:09:12.885
and depression

00:09:12.885 --> 00:09:14.453
in Russian society is so high

00:09:14.453 --> 00:09:16.856
when everyone is at the edge,

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.225
when mobilization is

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:21.360
something that people ask cared

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.328
very much.

00:09:22.328 --> 00:09:23.162
And, you know,

00:09:23.162 --> 00:09:25.331
we know that because we can see how that

00:09:25.364 --> 00:09:26.732
how many people watch us

00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:28.000
and millions of Russians

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.901
are asking questions

00:09:28.901 --> 00:09:31.304
about mobilization in particular.

00:09:31.337 --> 00:09:34.707
So Navalny, his death,

00:09:35.041 --> 00:09:38.044
if it happens, I mean, it's terrible.

00:09:38.044 --> 00:09:42.148
But if it happens, can be a huge trigger

00:09:42.481 --> 00:09:43.683
for Russian people

00:09:43.683 --> 00:09:46.152
to go out on the streets and to protest

00:09:46.152 --> 00:09:47.186
and to change something.

00:09:47.186 --> 00:09:48.754
I don't want this to happen, of course,

00:09:48.754 --> 00:09:50.222
and no one wants this to happen.

00:09:50.222 --> 00:09:51.991
And Putin doesn't want it to happen.

00:09:51.991 --> 00:09:52.959
So that's why

00:09:52.959 --> 00:09:54.694
they're not killing him in jail.

00:09:54.694 --> 00:09:55.795
This is the only good news

00:09:55.795 --> 00:09:56.729
for Alexei Navalny

00:09:56.729 --> 00:09:57.563
and for the

00:09:57.563 --> 00:09:58.831
for the civil society

00:09:58.831 --> 00:09:59.832
of Russian Federation.

00:09:59.832 --> 00:10:00.633
Which survives

00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:03.169
out of Russia, unfortunately, right now.

00:10:03.336 --> 00:10:04.003
So, yes,

00:10:04.003 --> 00:10:05.871
he's in a terrible circumstances.

00:10:05.871 --> 00:10:08.441
They're trying to break his personality.

00:10:08.741 --> 00:10:09.408
His stamina

00:10:09.408 --> 00:10:11.644
but he is proving every single day, Erin,

00:10:11.944 --> 00:10:12.812
if you look at him

00:10:12.812 --> 00:10:14.513
and if you look what he says,

00:10:14.513 --> 00:10:15.247
what he writes,

00:10:15.247 --> 00:10:16.315
what he tweets

00:10:16.315 --> 00:10:18.284
with the help of his lawyers,

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:20.653
you can see how strong this person is.

00:10:20.653 --> 00:10:23.389
And I am sure that he survives, actually.

00:10:24.056 --> 00:10:25.291
Catarina, thank you very much.

00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:26.726
General Kimmitt, thanks to you.

